{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["<b>They struck me</b> — striking, yet I did not feel the blow." "<b>When shall I awake?</b> — I will seek it." "<b>I will add</b> — to seek it continually."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {2 "The word נצח ('continually') may also carry the sense 'to the end'; the reading follows the interpretation that אוסיף refers to the drunkard resuming his quest for wine."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:26.524255513Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}